@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Secure Code Analysis in Azure DevOps";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="lead text-center">Enhance your application security by integrating secure code analysis into your DevOps pipeline.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">What is Secure Code Analysis?</h2>
        <p>
            Secure Code Analysis is the process of identifying vulnerabilities, security threats, and weaknesses in the source code before deployment. It helps ensure that applications are protected from potential attacks and compliance violations.
        </p>
        <p>
            By integrating secure code analysis into your CI/CD pipeline, you can detect security issues early and reduce the risk of deploying vulnerable software.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/secure-code-analysis.jpg" alt="Secure Code Analysis Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Secure Code Analysis improves software security and compliance.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits of Secure Code Analysis -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Benefits of Secure Code Analysis</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Early Detection of Vulnerabilities:</strong> Identifies security flaws in the development phase.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Automated Security Scanning:</strong> Ensures code is continuously monitored for threats.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Regulatory Compliance:</strong> Helps meet security standards like OWASP, NIST, and GDPR.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Risk Mitigation:</strong> Reduces the risk of security breaches and costly fixes post-deployment.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Integration with CI/CD:</strong> Seamlessly integrates into Azure Pipelines for continuous security assurance.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/secure-analysis-benefits.jpg" alt="Benefits of Secure Code Analysis" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Secure Code Analysis ensures software security and compliance.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How to Implement Secure Code Analysis in Azure DevOps -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">How to Implement Secure Code Analysis in Azure DevOps</h2>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item">Enable security tools like SonarQube, WhiteSource, or Microsoft Security Code Analysis.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Configure static code analysis rules in Azure Pipelines.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Integrate security testing tools like OWASP ZAP for dynamic analysis.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Set up automated alerts for security vulnerabilities.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Review and remediate issues before code is merged into production.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/secure-code-implementation.jpg" alt="Steps to Implement Secure Code Analysis" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Follow these steps to integrate Secure Code Analysis in Azure DevOps.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Best Practices for Secure Code Analysis -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Best Practices for Secure Code Analysis</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Use Automated Scanning:</strong> Schedule security scans as part of your CI/CD pipeline.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Enforce Security Policies:</strong> Define and enforce security rules for all code commits.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Conduct Regular Security Audits:</strong> Periodically review and improve security policies.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Train Developers on Secure Coding:</strong> Ensure development teams understand secure coding principles.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Monitor and Respond to Threats:</strong> Set up alerts for potential security vulnerabilities.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/secure-best-practices.jpg" alt="Best Practices for Secure Code Analysis" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Adopting best practices enhances software security and resilience.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Secure Code Analysis is an essential practice for building secure and reliable software applications. By integrating security tools into Azure DevOps and following best practices, teams can proactively detect and mitigate security threats before they impact production.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/secure-code-conclusion.jpg" alt="Secure Code Analysis Summary" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Secure Code Analysis strengthens application security in DevOps workflows.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
